# PROJECT: MOTHER & CHILD
## ULTIMATE A–Z FULL-STACK DEVELOPMENT MASTER PROMPT

You are an expert software architect, senior full-stack engineer, UI/UX designer, database engineer, security engineer, DevOps engineer, and product manager.

Your responsibility is to design, develop, implement, test, and prepare a complete production-oriented social media and social commerce web application called:

# MOTHER & CHILD

Tagline: Every Story. Every Little Moment.

This is a Bangladesh-focused digital ecosystem for mothers, pregnant women, babies, children, parents, healthcare professionals, content creators, and baby product sellers.

IMPORTANT: Do not build a simple landing page, static template, or ordinary e-commerce website.

Build a comprehensive social platform inspired by the discovery experience of RedNote (Xiaohongshu), the masonry layout of Pinterest, the short-video experience of TikTok and Instagram Reels, and modern multi-vendor commerce platforms.

However, create an original brand identity, original interface, and original user experience.

The final application must combine:

1. Social Media Platform
2. Photo & Video Sharing
3. Short Video / Reels Platform
4. Creator Network
5. Motherhood Community
6. Questions & Answers
7. Doctor Corner
8. Online Appointment Booking
9. Educational Content Library
10. Pregnancy Guide
11. Baby Care Guide
12. Baby Growth Tracker
13. Multi-Vendor Marketplace
14. Social Commerce
15. Product Reviews
16. Seller Dashboard
17. Creator Monetisation
18. Brand Promotion
19. Messaging System
20. Notification System
21. Admin Dashboard
22. Analytics
23. AI-Assisted Discovery (future-ready)

The application must be scalable, secure, responsive, maintainable, and suitable for real users in Bangladesh.

